   "file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "component": "tome",
   "section": "mod-tome/data/zones/golem-graveyard/objects.lua",
   "line": 38559,
   "source": "One of the ruby eyes of the legendary giant golem Atamathon.\nIt is said it was made by the halflings during the Age of Pyre as a weapon against the orcs. Even though it was destroyed, it managed to deal a crippling blow by killing their leader, Garkul the Devourer.",
   "target": "传奇巨型傀儡阿塔玛森的红宝石眼睛之一。\n据说它是半身人在烈火纪为了对抗兽人所造的武器。虽然它被破坏了，但它仍杀死了兽人的首领吞噬者加库尔，给了对方沉重一击。",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "occurrences": 1
  },
  {
   "revision_key": "entry-02982",
   "entry_id": "entry-02982",
   "file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "component": "tome",
   "section": "mod-tome/data/zones/high-peak/grids.lua",
   "line": 38726,
   "source": "A farportal is a way to travel incredible distances in the blink of an eye. They usually require an external item to use. You have no idea if it is even two-way.\nThis one seems to go to an unknown place, seemingly out of this world. You dare not use it.",
   "target": "远行传送门能让人眨眼间跨越难以想象的距离。它们通常需要借助外部物品才能使用。你不知道这道门是否为双向的。\n这道门似乎通向未知之地，似乎为世外之地，你不太敢使用它。",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "occurrences": 1
  },
  {
